<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.UpdateKeyValue(Key: string, Value: string, Checked: boolean, OriginalValue: string): uuid`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key llUpdateKeyValue(string Key, string Value, integer Checked, string OriginalValue);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Start an asynchronous transaction to update a key-value pair associated with the script&#39;s <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Experience" target="_blank">Experience</a> with the given key (<b>k</b>) and value (<b>v</b>).</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Key/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>) that can be used to identify the corresponding <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event to determine if this command succeeded or failed and the results.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Key / k</td>
          <td>The key for the key-value pair</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Value / v</td>
          <td>The value for the key-value pair. Maximum 2047 characters, or 4095 if using Mono.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Checked / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">checked</a></td>
          <td>If <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> the update will only happen if <b>original_value</b> matches the value in the key-value store.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>OriginalValue / original_value</td>
          <td>The value to compare with the current value in the key-value store.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>data_storage</li>
        <li>dataserver</li>
        <li>experience</li>
        <li>experience_data</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
